>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Glowfish Interactive","Rangatang"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\r\nViol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"12"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"usk":{"descriptors":"Schimpfw\u00f6rte\r\nFantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"15 May, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cNubs aims to deliver fast-paced, arena-based battles for up to four players, fighting in chaotic brawls using quirk-based characters, daft weapons, and lethal traps\u2013and it looks pretty damn great.\u201d<br>Forbes<br><br>\u201cNubs! is a multiplayer brawler. Not like Smash Bros, mind you. Looking at it, it reminds me of The Legend of Zelda: Four Swords.\u201d<br>Destructoid<br><br>\u201cAwesomenauts devs reclaim their unfinished game as new studio Rangatang\u201d<br>GamesIndustry<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/11b42246005ccc181dd496166d1107c21858c900/ss_11b42246005ccc181dd496166d1107c21858c900.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747043775","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/11b42246005ccc181dd496166d1107c21858c900/ss_11b42246005ccc181dd496166d1107c21858c900.600x338.jpg?t=1747043775"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/d7948b147c0b1e3eb5943a65216995fc600a1862/ss_d7948b147c0b1e3eb5943a65216995fc600a1862.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747043775","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337860/d7948b147c0b1e3eb5943a65216995fc600a1862/ss_d7948b147c0b1e3eb5943a65216995fc600a1862.600x338.jpg?t=1747043775"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steam